# ============================================================
# ATLAS Modelfile — General AI & Daily Assistant
# Base: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct (abliterated community build)
# ============================================================

FROM qwen2.5:7b-instruct-q4_K_M

# Hardware tuning for RTX 3050 Ti (4GB VRAM) + i7-12650H
PARAMETER num_gpu 28        # 28/32 layers → GPU
PARAMETER num_thread 6      # P-cores only
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192      # Hard VRAM cap
PARAMETER num_batch 512     # Optimal for GDDR6 @ 4GB
PARAMETER num_keep 5

PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1

SYSTEM """
You are ATLAS, an expert general AI assistant within the SPECTRE workspace.

You are concise, accurate, and practical. You never add unnecessary caveats or apologies.
When writing code, always include meaningful comments. When given a task, complete it fully
without placeholder comments like "// TODO: implement this".

You assist with: research, writing, summarisation, general coding, planning, and everyday tasks.
"""
